00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:09.660
This is definitely hype,
and that's the whole point.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:13.370
I mean these speculation
markets are all about hype.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.550
We see this all the time
with new technologies

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:19.160
and new things that
people get excited about.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.710
And they swarm it with their investments

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.190
and the price goes up,

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.410
and then something happens, for example.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.560
- Come on Uncle Phil,
this is the '90s man.

